      "version": "1.1.1",
      "description": "<p>New:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Brand new melee weapon: <strong>Katana Nikitakiri</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom animation and sound effect.</li>\n<li>Model and texture assets came from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/katana-aec45be9d79d4c0885c2ec7fb106fd4b\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/katana-aec45be9d79d4c0885c2ec7fb106fd4b</a> with <strong>CC Attribution</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fixes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(IMPORTANT)</strong> Fixed T725 faulty data json causing server crash when using with some mods.</li>\n<li>Fixed type64 SMG hand not gripping on right places.</li>\n<li>Fixed BAL-27 inspect animation pressing magazine release button not on the right place.</li>\n<li>Fixed QBZs and JAK-12 shot sound. Now they sound more naturely at distance.</li>\n<li>Fixed some locales.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Changes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Reworked JAK-12 based on AA-12 armature.</li>\n</ul>\n",
