      "version": "1.1.0",
      "description": "<p><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong>\n<strong>If you are experiencing server crashes with this update, download the fix in the addons.</strong></p>\n<p>New:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>FSS Harricane 5.7x28 submachine gun (Not AR-57, COD MW II)</li>\n<li>Tempus 725 12ga double-barrel shotgun (Not 725, COD MW)</li>\n<li>Kalashnikov \"RPKN\" 7.62x39 light machine gun (Not a true RPK, COD MW II)</li>\n<li>JAK AR-15 5.56x45 assault rifle (3D-Printed AR-15, COD MW III)</li>\n<li>Something else</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fixes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed some locales define order so that none Ch or En client will load En locales first.</li>\n<li>Fixed some locales error.</li>\n<li>Fixed M14 animation error when using a 10-round mag.</li>\n<li>Disabled malfunction for weapons with faulty malfunction statemachine or animation.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Changes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>New transparent material for BAL-27 mag.</li>\n<li>Changed acquiring method for some items.</li>\n</ul>\n",
